---LINES
---SCREEN
=video attributes help

  change an value:              ." logical type of lines : "................
               .:SP...            CMD - initial text mode (restored on exit)
               .:DE...            TXT - text                                
                                  HDR - header                              
  change focus of input:          VAR - variable                            
  switch w/r : .:KI....           ALT - alterator
     set "w" : .'w or .'o         MSE - menu selection point                
     set "r" : .'r or .'i         ERR - error message                       
                                  ATT - attention (warning message)         
  change setting s mode:          
          .'0 .'1 .'2 .'3         /set "w"/
                                            is used when write lines
                                  /set "r"/ 
                                            is applied on active line 
---END
* line is a thing which links data and representation in variety of aspects
